Subject: [PATCH v2 5/5] ARM: dts: qcom: align SDHCI clocks with DT schema
Date:   Mon, 11 Jul 2022 10:29:40 +0200
Message-Id: <20220711082940.39539-6-krzysztof.kozlowski@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
